      "id": "claim_d4f5a64d5a624ae49ba14e028bb7d2cb",
      "statement": "LoopService is a facade that keeps the loop subsystem's external method surface stable while delegating substantive work to focused sub-services constructed in its constructor: LoopLifecycleService (continue/retry/split), LoopWorkerExecutorService (maker/checker execution and worker-approval decisions), LoopVerificationService (completion gates), LoopDiscoveryService (finding scanners), LoopBudgetService (budgets/escalation/cost), WorktreeManager (git worktrees), WorkerLeaseRepo (worker_leases persistence and lineage), LoopEventService (loop_events), LoopRunQueryService/LoopRunMutationService (loop_runs read/write), LoopRecoveryService (crash recovery), RuntimeCommandService (runtime contracts/process spawning), and LoopPersistenceService (LOOP_STATE.md, diffs, evidence dirs). The continue/split/retry entrypoints delegate to this.lifecycle, verify/certify to this.verification, and executeMaker/executeChecker to this.workerExecutor.",
